          "type": "demo",
          "kind": "html",
          "label": "직접 만져 보라. 화면은 어디서도 읽지 않는다",
          "height": "360px",
          "text": "<style>\n  body { font: 14px/1.7 system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; color: #e2e8f0; }\n  .panel { background:#0b1220; border-radius:10px; padding:12px; }\n  button { font: inherit; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #334155;\n           background:#1e293b; color:#e2e8f0; cursor:pointer; }\n  button:hover { border-color:#60a5fa; }\n  input { font: inherit; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #334155;\n          background:#0f172a; color:#e2e8f0; }\n  ul { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:8px 0 0; }\n  li { display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; padding:6px 8px; background:#111c33; border-radius:8px; margin-bottom:6px; }\n  .log { font: 12.5px/1.6 ui-monospace, monospace; color:#94a3b8; white-space:pre-wrap; margin-top:8px; }\n  .hint { font-size:12.5px; color:#94a3b8; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n  <form id=\"f\" style=\"display:flex;gap:6px\">\n    <input id=\"t\" placeholder=\"할 일\" style=\"flex:1\">\n    <button>추가</button>\n  </form>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px\">\n    <button data-f=\"all\">전부</button><button data-f=\"open\">남은 것</button><button data-f=\"done\">끝난 것</button>\n  </div>\n  <ul id=\"list\"></ul>\n  <div class=\"log\" id=\"log\"></div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  /* 진실 */\n  let todos = [{ id: 1, text: '사료 사기', done: false }, { id: 2, text: '모래 갈기', done: true }];\n  let filter = 'all';\n  const list = document.getElementById('list'), log = document.getElementById('log');\n\n  /* 진실 -> 화면. 이 함수는 화면에서 아무것도 읽지 않는다 */\n  function render() {\n    const shown = todos.filter((t) => filter === 'all' || (filter === 'done') === t.done);\n    list.replaceChildren(...shown.map((t) => {\n      const li = document.createElement('li');\n      const cb = document.createElement('input');\n      cb.type = 'checkbox'; cb.checked = t.done; cb.dataset.id = t.id;\n      const span = document.createElement('span');\n      span.textContent = t.text;\n      span.style.textDecoration = t.done ? 'line-through' : 'none';\n      const del = document.createElement('button');\n      del.textContent = '지우기'; del.dataset.del = t.id; del.style.marginLeft = 'auto';\n      li.append(cb, span, del);\n      return li;\n    }));\n    log.textContent = '상태: ' + JSON.stringify(todos.map((t) => (t.done ? '[x] ' : '[ ] ') + t.text)) + '  ·  보기: ' + filter;\n  }\n\n  /* 사건 -> 진실 */\n  document.getElementById('f').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const input = document.getElementById('t');\n    if (!input.value.trim()) return;\n    todos = [...todos, { id: Date.now(), text: input.value.trim(), done: false }];\n    input.value = '';\n    render();\n  });\n  document.body.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    const f = e.target.closest('[data-f]');\n    if (f) { filter = f.dataset.f; render(); return; }\n    const d = e.target.closest('[data-del]');\n    if (d) { todos = todos.filter((t) => t.id !== Number(d.dataset.del)); render(); }\n  });\n  document.body.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n    const cb = e.target.closest('input[type=checkbox]');\n    if (!cb) return;\n    todos = todos.map((t) => (t.id === Number(cb.dataset.id) ? { ...t, done: cb.checked } : t));\n    render();\n  });\n  render();\n</script>"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "화면에서 값을 다시 읽어(`li.textContent`, `cb.checked`) 판단하기 시작하면, 곧 화면과 자료가 어긋난다. **읽는 곳은 진실 하나**, 화면은 쓰기 전용이라고 정해 두면 버그가 절반으로 준다."
